	(text "When the internal transistor is turned off,\nthere is no current flowing so there is no\nvoltage drop across teh resisstor so 5V\nWhen the internal transistor is turned on,\nCurrent flows through thte resisitor and \ntransistior to ground, the output drops to\na low voltage"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 87.884 22.606 0)
